---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Cyber Incident Reporting Assistant">
  <div class="shell page">
    <div class="kicker">// PROJECT 01 · PROTOTYPE</div>
    <h1>Cyber Incident Reporting Assistant.</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">A guided workflow concept for helping non-specialists understand cyber-incident reporting requirements and prepare a structured report.</p>
    <div class="article"><div class="prose">
      <h2>The problem</h2>
      <p>Security reporting requirements can be difficult to navigate when an organization does not have a dedicated security team. The idea is to turn a confusing decision into a clear guided workflow.</p>
      <h2>The approach</h2>
      <p>The prototype is intentionally AI-assisted rather than AI-dependent: deterministic questions and validation guide the process, while AI can help explain technical context and draft human-readable text.</p>
      <h2>Stack direction</h2>
      <div class="tags"><span class="tag">Python</span><span class="tag">Next.js</span><span class="tag">PostgreSQL</span></div>
      <h2>Status</h2>
      <p>Prototype / active learning project. More implementation details, screenshots, and source links will be added as the project matures.</p>
    </div></div>
  </div>
</Base>
